</span></span>
<span id="A2.SS1.SSS1.Px2.p1.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.SSS1.Px2.p1.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:50%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Current context:
Slot Status:
- Filled slots: {filled_slots}
- Unfilled slots: {unfilled_slots}
</span></span>
<span id="A2.SS1.SSS1.Px2.p1.pic1.1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.SSS1.Px2.p1.pic1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:50%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Return ONLY the JSON list of indices:

</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
